{"title":"Career Roadmap: Illustrator","role":"Illustrator","summary":"An Illustrator creates visual artwork to communicate ideas, stories, information or emotions for:","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts - General / Honours)","Course":"Fine Arts (BA)"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop strong drawing, visual storytelling, composition, digital illustration, design software and professional portfolio skills"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Illustrator creates visual artwork to communicate ideas, stories, information or emotions for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Books"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Advertising"},{"text":"Publishing"},{"text":"Editorial content"},{"text":"Children's media"},{"text":"Games"},{"text":"Animation"},{"text":"Websites"},{"text":"Apps"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"Educational content"},{"text":"Comics"},{"text":"Graphic novels"},{"text":"Concept development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The professional workflow is generally:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Brief","Research","Concept","Sketches","Visual Development","Illustration","Digital Refinement","Review","Final Artwork","Delivery"]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Fine Arts provides the foundation in drawing, painting, visual composition, art history and creative practice, but a professional illustrator should additionally develop digital illustration, visual storytelling, software skills, portfolio development and commercial workflow."},{"type":"p","text":"Graduates commonly begin as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Illustration Intern","Junior Illustrator","Illustrator","Senior Illustrator","Lead Illustrator / Art Director"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Drawing & visual fundamentals"},{"text":"Drawing, perspective, color, composition"},{"text":"Sketchbook portfolio"},{"text":"Relying only on software"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Illustration & visual storytelling"},{"text":"Character, environment, narrative art"},{"text":"Illustration series"},{"text":"Inconsistent visual quality"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Digital & commercial illustration"},{"text":"Photoshop, Illustrator, Procreate, publishing"},{"text":"Client-style projects"},{"text":"No commercial portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 4*"},{"text":"Professional specialization"},{"text":"Editorial, children's, concept, game or advertising art"},{"text":"Professional portfolio + internship"},{"text":"Too many unrelated styles"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"*For a 4-year honours structure. In a 3-year BA, incorporate the advanced specialization into the final year."}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1 — Drawing Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Line"},{"text":"Shape"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Value"},{"text":"Texture"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Light and shadow"},{"text":"Basic anatomy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gesture drawing"},{"text":"Still life"},{"text":"Object studies"},{"text":"Figure drawing"},{"text":"Architectural sketches"},{"text":"Nature studies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build a daily sketchbook habit."},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2 — Color & Visual Composition"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Color theory"},{"text":"Hue"},{"text":"Saturation"},{"text":"Value"},{"text":"Warm/cool relationships"},{"text":"Color harmony"},{"text":"Contrast"},{"text":"Lighting"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Composition"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Symmetry/asymmetry"},{"text":"Focal points"},{"text":"Negative space"},{"text":"Depth"},{"text":"Scale"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Color studies"},{"text":"Environment paintings"},{"text":"Object illustrations"},{"text":"Poster-style artwork"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3 — Illustration Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual storytelling"},{"text":"Character design"},{"text":"Environment design"},{"text":"Object design"},{"text":"Scene composition"},{"text":"Facial expressions"},{"text":"Body language"},{"text":"Gesture"},{"text":"Narrative sequencing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to communicate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Who","Where","What","Why","Emotion","Action"]},{"type":"p","text":"An illustrator should be able to tell a story visually without relying entirely on text."}]},{"heading":"Traditional Illustration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Maintain strong traditional-art skills."},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"h","text":"Drawing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Graphite"},{"text":"Charcoal"},{"text":"Ink"},{"text":"Pen"},{"text":"Colored pencils"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Painting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Watercolor"},{"text":"Acrylic"},{"text":"Gouache"},{"text":"Oil awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mixed Media"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collage"},{"text":"Ink + watercolor"},{"text":"Digital + traditional"},{"text":"Texture-based illustration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional techniques improve observation and visual decision-making even when the final artwork is digital."}]},{"heading":"Digital Illustration","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn at least one professional digital workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Raster"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Photoshop"},{"text":"Procreate"},{"text":"Krita"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Vector"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Affinity Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Painting"},{"t